{"seq":1,"slug":"network-cpm","title":"大学工程管理 — 网络计划技术与关键路径法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-control-techniques/network-cpm","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学工程管理-网络计划技术与关键路径法\">大学工程管理 — 网络计划技术与关键路径法</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>一个工程项目由成百上千项任务组成，它们之间有复杂的先后依赖：地基没打好不能砌墙，墙没砌好不能上屋顶，但水电和门窗或许可以并行。面对这张错综复杂的&quot;任务网&quot;，管理者最想知道两件事：<strong>整个项目最快多久能完成？哪些任务一旦延误就会拖累整个工期？</strong> 回答这两个问题的工具，就是<strong>网络计划技术</strong>，其核心是<strong>关键路径法（CPM，Critical Path Method）</strong>。</p>\n<p>CPM 把项目画成一张逻辑网络图，通过计算每项任务的最早/最晚时间，找出那条决定总工期的&quot;关键路径&quot;——这条路径上的任务一天都不能拖。而非关键任务则有&quot;时差&quot;，可以灵活安排。掌握 CPM，管理者就从&quot;凭感觉排工期&quot;升级到&quot;用算法掐工期&quot;，这是项目进度控制的基本功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"从任务清单到网络图\">从任务清单到网络图</h3><p>CPM 的第一步是理清任务及其依赖关系，列成表。以一个简化的小型建房项目为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>工期(天)</th>\n<th>紧前任务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A 设计</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 采购材料</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 打地基</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D 砌墙</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>B, C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E 屋顶</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F 室内装修</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G 验收</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>E, F</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>据此画出网络图（箭头表示依赖方向）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[A 设计 4] --&gt; B[B 采购 3]&#10;    A --&gt; C[C 地基 5]&#10;    B --&gt; D[D 砌墙 6]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[E 屋顶 4]&#10;    D --&gt; F[F 装修 5]&#10;    E --&gt; G[G 验收 2]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[A 设计 4] --&gt; B[B 采购 3]\n    A --&gt; C[C 地基 5]\n    B --&gt; D[D 砌墙 6]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[E 屋顶 4]\n    D --&gt; F[F 装修 5]\n    E --&gt; G[G 验收 2]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h3 id=\"正推与逆推-计算四个时间\">正推与逆推：计算四个时间</h3><p>CPM 的核心是为每项任务算出四个时间：最早开始（ES）、最早完成（EF）、最晚开始（LS）、最晚完成（LF）。</p>\n<p><strong>正向计算（求 ES/EF，从前往后取最大）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>工期</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF = ES + 工期</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">工期</span></span></span></span></span>，后续任务的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ES</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> = 所有紧前任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>最大值</strong>（必须等最慢的前置完成）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A: ES=0, EF=4</li>\n<li>B: ES=4, EF=7；C: ES=4, EF=9</li>\n<li>D: ES=max(7,9)=9, EF=15（要等更慢的 C）</li>\n<li>E: ES=15, EF=19；F: ES=15, EF=20</li>\n<li>G: ES=max(19,20)=20, EF=22</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以<strong>项目总工期 = 22 天</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>反向计算（求 LS/LF，从后往前取最小）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>工期</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LS = LF - 工期</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">工期</span></span></span></span></span>，前置任务的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> = 所有紧后任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>最小值</strong>。从 G 的 LF=22 倒推回去即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"总时差与关键路径\">总时差与关键路径</h3><p><strong>总时差（Total Float）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= LS - ES = LF - EF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，表示一项任务在不影响总工期前提下可以拖延的最大天数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>总时差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的任务就是<strong>关键任务</strong>，它们串成的链条就是<strong>关键路径</strong>。</li>\n<li>总时差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的任务有&quot;机动余地&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本例中算出 B 有 2 天时差（地基 C 比采购 B 慢，B 可晚开工），E 有 1 天时差（装修 F 比屋顶 E 慢）。而 <strong>A→C→D→F→G</strong> 全程时差为 0，即为关键路径，总长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4+5+6+5+2 = 22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span></span></span></span></span> 天。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[A 4] --&gt; C[C 5] --&gt; D[D 6] --&gt; F[F 5] --&gt; G[G 2]\">graph LR\n    A[A 4] --&gt; C[C 5] --&gt; D[D 6] --&gt; F[F 5] --&gt; G[G 2]</pre><p><strong>关键路径的管理意义</strong>：这条路径上任何一项任务延误一天，整个项目就延误一天；而非关键任务（如 B、E）在其时差范围内延误不影响总工期。这给了管理者明确的优先级——<strong>盯紧关键任务、对关键任务投入资源，非关键任务可适度放松</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工期优化-赶工的取舍\">工期优化：赶工的取舍</h3><p>若 22 天太长，需要压缩工期，就要&quot;赶工（crashing）&quot;——给任务追加资源以缩短工期。但有两条铁律：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>只压缩关键路径上的任务才有用</strong>。压缩非关键任务（如给 B 加人）纯属浪费钱，总工期纹丝不动。</li>\n<li><strong>压缩要算性价比</strong>，选&quot;赶工成本斜率最低&quot;的关键任务先压。赶工成本斜率定义为：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>赶工成本斜率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>赶工后成本</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>正常成本</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>正常工期</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>赶工后工期</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>元</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>天</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">赶工成本斜率 = \\frac{赶工后成本 - 正常成本}{正常工期 - 赶工后工期}\\ (元/天)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">赶工成本斜率</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正常工期</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">赶工后工期</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">赶工后成本</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正常成本</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">元</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如关键任务 D 每缩短 1 天需多花 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万元、F 每天需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，那就优先压 D。还要警惕：随着关键路径被压缩，<strong>原来的非关键路径可能&quot;反超&quot;成为新的关键路径</strong>，此时再压原路径就无效了。赶工本质是&quot;花钱买时间&quot;，必须与第二章的工期-成本权衡结合，找到总成本最低的工期点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用本节任务表，自己完整算一遍每个任务的 ES/EF/LS/LF 和总时差，验证关键路径是否为 A→C→D→F→G。</li>\n<li>为什么后续任务的 ES 要取所有紧前任务 EF 的&quot;最大值&quot;，而反推 LF 要取&quot;最小值&quot;？</li>\n<li>总时差为零意味着什么？为什么管理者要把资源重点投在关键任务上？</li>\n<li>项目经理想给任务 B 加派两名工人来抢工期，这样做有意义吗？为什么？</li>\n<li>解释&quot;赶工成本斜率&quot;，并说明为什么压缩到一定程度后，继续压缩原关键路径可能不再有效。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《网络计划技术》（双代号/单代号网络图）国家标准 GB/T 50502</li>\n<li>关键链项目管理（CCPM，Goldratt《关键链》）——对 CPM 的批判与改进</li>\n<li>Microsoft Project / P6 软件——自动绘制网络图、计算关键路径</li>\n<li>曼哈顿计划与北极星导弹项目——CPM/PERT 技术的历史起源</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网络计划技术把项目任务的依赖关系画成逻辑网络，关键路径法（CPM）通过正推（求 ES/EF，取最大）和逆推（求 LS/LF，取最小）算出每项任务的时间窗，进而得到总时差。总时差为零的任务构成关键路径，它决定项目总工期、一天都不能拖；非关键任务在时差内可灵活安排。压缩工期时，只有压缩关键任务才有效，且要按赶工成本斜率从低到高选择，并警惕关键路径转移。CPM 让进度管理从凭感觉走向可计算。下一节我们把进度与成本统一起来，学习挣值管理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学工程管理 — 网络计划技术与关键路径法","id":"大学工程管理-网络计划技术与关键路径法"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"从任务清单到网络图","id":"从任务清单到网络图"},{"level":3,"text":"正推与逆推：计算四个时间","id":"正推与逆推-计算四个时间"},{"level":3,"text":"总时差与关键路径","id":"总时差与关键路径"},{"level":3,"text":"工期优化：赶工的取舍","id":"工期优化-赶工的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学工程管理 — 工程安全管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/construction-quality-safety/construction-safety-management"},"next":{"title":"大学工程管理 — 挣值管理（EVM）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-control-techniques/earned-value-management"}}